  "rationale": "the second of the two evenings (witness 1: \"The second night\"), taken as 2023-10-15: the one evening of October 2023 with a freshly launched Starlink train to the south-east between 7 and 9 pm, as witness 4 saw on his second evening; \"The next day between 7-9pm\"; started so that the string of lights falls when Starlink 2023-153 was in the south-east (18:59-19:04)"
 },
